# Goblin Patrol: "Echo {R}" is "at the beginning of YOUR upkeep, if this came under YOUR control since the beginning of YOUR
# last upkeep" (CR 702.30a). Bot2's Mind Control takes Bot1's Goblin Patrol on turn 2. At Bot1's upkeep on turn 3 nothing
# triggers: it is not under Bot1's control. At Bot2's upkeep on turn 4 it came under Bot2's control since their last upkeep
# (turn 2, before the Aura was cast), so Bot2 is asked and declines: Goblin Patrol is sacrificed, into its owner Bot1's
# graveyard, and Mind Control, with nothing to enchant, into Bot2's.

[Bot1 Deck]
Goblin Patrol
Mox Ruby
Mountain x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Mox Sapphire
Mind Control
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Goblin Patrol.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire#1.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire#2.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Mind Control.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Goblin Patrol)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield.Goblin Patrol.Tapped = false
[T3 Bot1.Upkeep]
? Stack.Count = 0
[T4 Bot2.Upkeep]
? Stack.Count = 1
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Decline

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Goblin Patrol
Bot2.Graveyard = Mind Control; Black Lotus
Bot2.Battlefield = Mox Sapphire; Mox Sapphire
